{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "text-reveal-card",
  "title": "文字揭示卡片",
  "description": "用于鼠标滑过卡片时揭示另一段隐藏文字、带星星粒子的卡片组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "aceternity-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "卡片的额外类名。"
    },
    {
      "name": "starsCount",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "控制生成的星星数量。",
      "default": "130"
    },
    {
      "name": "starsClass",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "应用于漂浮星星的额外类名。"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "header",
      "description": "String"
    },
    {
      "name": "text",
      "description": "卡片未悬停时显示的默认文字。"
    },
    {
      "name": "revealText",
      "description": "悬停卡片时显示的文字。"
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/text-reveal-card/TextRevealCardDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "深色卡片内做「滑动揭示隐藏文案」的互动彩蛋。",
    "两段文案的前后对比展示（如乱码与原文、暗示与答案）。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "大面积双层内容的鼠标遮罩揭示，改用 svg-mask。",
    "刮开涂层式互动，改用 scratch-to-reveal。",
    "单段文字的悬停描边效果，改用 text-hover-effect。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "内容需分别放入 text（默认显示）与 revealText（揭示后显示）具名插槽，另有 header 插槽放标题区。",
    "starsCount 控制漂浮星星数量（默认 130），starsClass 自定义星星样式。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add text-reveal-card"
  },
  "sourceRefs": {
